<title>USA: Just Toys names David Schwartz as CFO.</title>
<headline>Just Toys names David Schwartz as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just Toys Inc said on Tuesday that David Schwartz was named chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>Schwartz is replacing Michael Vastola, who resigned, the company said.</p>
<p>Schwartz was most recently chief financial officer of Philips Industries, a maker of women's hair and cosmetic accessories.</p>
